; rawscan fixture F1 (R5, replaceDrawParameterBuiltins): the BaseVertex
; builtin variable sits at id 10 and an OpConstant carries the VALUE 10.
; The constant is a genuine operand of the OpIAdd; nothing but the
; constant's literal word mentions 10. A raw word scan reads the
; constant as a use of the pointer outside OpLoad and declines a
; servable module; the operand-aware scan converts it.
OpCapability Shader
OpCapability DrawParameters
OpMemoryModel Logical GLSL450
OpEntryPoint Vertex %20 "main" %10 %12
OpDecorate %10 BuiltIn BaseVertex
OpDecorate %12 Location 0
%2 = OpTypeInt 32 1
%3 = OpTypePointer Input %2
%10 = OpVariable %3 Input
%4 = OpTypePointer Output %2
%12 = OpVariable %4 Output
%1 = OpTypeVoid
%5 = OpTypeFunction %1
%11 = OpConstant %2 10
%20 = OpFunction %1 None %5
%21 = OpLabel
%22 = OpLoad %2 %10
%23 = OpIAdd %2 %22 %11
OpStore %12 %23
OpReturn
OpFunctionEnd
